"horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1075","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,74,48,52,26,31],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"6050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019905","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1075","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,74,48,52,26,31],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"6050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019905","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1075","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,74,48,52,26,31],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"6050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019905","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1075","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,74,48,52,26,31],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019905","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10172","city":"CS1075","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,74,48,52,26,31],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"110","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019905","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"匈奴单于冒顿单于之后，于夫罗之子，汉光文帝刘渊之父，匈奴左贤王。中平五年，南匈奴发生动乱，刘豹因此留居汉地。建安元年，他的叔父呼厨泉在於夫罗死后继位单于，刘豹则成为左贤王（这是匈奴单于继承人的称号）。后来刘豹接掌了匈奴左部。曹操将南匈奴部分分为五部，刘豹便是其中一部的统帅。刘豹寿命极长，从东汉末年一直活跃至西晋初年。他通过联姻（妻子呼延氏为匈奴贵族）和军事威慑巩固地位，并培养其子刘渊接受汉文化教育。刘豹死后，刘渊继任左部帅，最终在西晋“八王之乱”中崛起，建立汉赵政权。","tc":"匈奴單于冒頓單于之后，于夫羅之子，漢光文帝劉淵之父，匈奴左賢王。中平五年，南匈奴發生動亂，劉豹因此留居漢地。建安元年，他的叔父呼廚泉在於夫羅死后繼位單于，劉豹則成為左賢王（這是匈奴單于繼承人的稱號）。后來劉豹接掌了匈奴左部。曹操將南匈奴部分分為五部，劉豹便是其中一部的統帥。劉豹壽命極長，從東漢末年一直活躍至西晉初年。他通過聯姻（妻子呼延氏為匈奴貴族）和軍事威懾鞏固地位，并培養其子劉淵接受漢文化教育。劉豹死后，劉淵繼任左部帥，最終在西晉“八王之亂”中崛起，建立漢趙政權。","en":"A descendant of the Xiongnu Chanyu Modu and son of Yufuluo. He was the father of Liu Yuan, Emperor Guangwen of Han, and held the title of Left Worthy King of the Xiongnu. In 188 AD, a rebellion erupted among the Southern Xiongnu, and Liu Bao remained settled in Han territory. In 196 AD, after his uncle Huchuquan succeeded Yufuluo as Chanyu, Liu Bao became Left Worthy King (the title for the heir to the Xiongnu Chanyu). Liu Bao subsequently assumed leadership of the Xiongnu Left Division. When Cao Cao divided the Southern Xiongnu into five divisions, Liu Bao became the commander of one of them. Liu Bao lived an exceptionally long life, remaining active from the late Eastern Han well into the early Western Jin dynasty. Through strategic marriage alliances (his wife, Lady Huyan, was of Xiongnu nobility) and military power, he consolidated his position and ensured his son Liu Yuan received an education in Han culture. After Liu Bao's death, Liu Yuan succeeded him as commander of the Left Division and ultimately rose to prominence during the Western Jin's ‘War of the Eight Princes’, founding the Han-Zhao regime.","jp":"匈奴の冒頓単于の末裔であり、於夫羅の子、漢の光文帝劉淵の父にあたる匈奴の左賢王。中平5年、南匈奴で動乱が発生したため、劉豹は漢の地に留まることとなった。建安元年、於夫羅の死後に叔父の呼廚泉が単于を継承すると、劉豹は左賢王（匈奴における単于後継者の称号）となった。後に劉豹は匈奴の左部を統率することとなる。曹操が南匈奴を五部に分割した際には、そのうちの一部の統率者を務めた。劉豹は寿命が極めて長く、東漢末から西晋の初年に至るまで活躍した。彼は婚姻（妻の呼延氏は匈奴の貴族）や軍事的威圧によって地位を固め、息子の劉淵に漢文化の教育を受けさせた。劉豹の死後は劉淵が左部帥を継ぎ、やがて西晋の「八王の乱」の中で台頭して漢趙政権を樹立することとなる。","kr":"흉노 묵돌선우의 후손이자 어부라의 아들이며, 한 광문제 유연의 아버지인 흉노 좌현왕입니다. 중평 5년, 남흉노에 변란이 일어나자 유표는 한나라 땅에 머물게 되었습니다. 건안 원년, 어부라가 사망한 뒤 숙부 호주천이 선우의 위에 오르자 좌현왕(흉노 선우 후계자의 칭호)이 되었습니다. 이후 흉노 좌부를 통솔하게 되었으며, 조조가 남흉노를 5부로 나누었을 때 한 부의 통수가 되었습니다. 유표는 수명이 매우 길어 동한 말기부터 서진 초년까지 오랜 기간 활약했습니다. 혼인(아내인 호연씨는 흉노 귀족)과 군사적 위세를 통해 지위를 공고히 다졌고, 아들 유연에게 한족 문화를 배우게 했습니다. 유표가 세상을 떠난 뒤 좌부수를 계승한 유연은 서진의 '팔왕의 난'을 틈타 세력을 키워 한조 정권을 세우게 됩니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10600","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"豹","nameTc":"豹","nameEn":"Bao","nameJp":"豹","nameKr":"표","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"刘豹","power":"WJ10172","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1075","gender":"0","rule":"73","force":"74","wise":"48","politics":"52","charm":"26","will":"31","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"2","weaponMaster":"28/28/28/75/28/37/50/28","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012105","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5300","battleSoulPoint":"5400","debateSoulPoint":"2300","strategy":"1001305","strategy2":"1001015","professions":"2/2/4/3/0/0/2/0/0/0/3/2/0/0/2/0/2/0/0/1/0/2/2/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"18","loyalty":"120","reputation":"3250","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"173","show":"185","death":"279","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019905","treasure":"","horse":"WP1001515","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;5/1;7/1;9/1;10/1;22/1;45/1;3/1;28/0;30/0","father":"WJ10172/100","mother":"","children":"WJ1012915/